  "ingredients": [
    "cooking spray",
    "4 cups fresh blueberries",
    "0.5 cup white sugar",
    "1 tablespoon all-purpose flour",
    "0.75 cup brown sugar",
    "0.75 cup all-purpose flour",
    "0.5 cup rolled oats",
    "0.5 teaspoon salt",
    "0.5 teaspoon ground cinnamon, or to taste",
    "0.25 teaspoon baking soda",
    "0.33333334326744 cup cold butter, cut into small cubes"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients. Preheat the oven to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C). Grease an 8-inch square baking dish with cooking spray.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/3jB3VD_RTMb7gaab3--QQqlZvao=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/273546-blueberry-crisp-VAT-005-step-01-1fa3d227f4d3432bab631cf9a6038755.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/273546/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "To make the filling: Combine blueberries, sugar, and flour in a large bowl; toss gently until evenly coated. Pour into the prepared baking dish.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/txwsaNJhfVXMMdvDplXn70HsBo0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/273546-blueberry-crisp-VAT-006-step-02-6179e6a51bc6430b80ed78ff9b1d7192.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/273546/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "To make the topping: Combine brown sugar, flour, oats, salt, cinnamon, and baking soda in a separate bowl. Cut in cold butter with 2 knives or a pastry blender until mixture resembles coarse crumbs.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/teMF709L4QYFdzQMaV12agiq63E=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/273546-blueberry-crisp-VAT-007-step-03-d7b1de071ccf449d9ffb8b4543f86a9d.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/273546/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Sprinkle evenly over blueberry mixture.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/8z9y_yQvZBS7_14Ey3qK_68iwPs=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/273546-blueberry-crisp-VAT-008-step-04-ffdc54c072bc431eb108b4e77e4de3a6.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/273546/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven until blueberries are bubbling and the crisp is golden brown on top, about 30 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/qXbjmXvFNYyNNLI53LkVEHZCHAs=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/273546-blueberry-crisp-VAT-009-step-05-5556bb6ba8034e0eabd03c8f80ce7fa1.jpg"
